ller_assembly" (path "/3651c362-5796-5920-9620-9dbbec9479b5/23a95925-f15c-5440-b9db-4a500db806ba" (reference "#FLG9004") (unit 1))))) (wire (pts (xy 236.22 551.18) (xy 236.22 556.26)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "b3387903-553b-569d-9bc2-bdda7b0d9de6")) (label "ESP_3V3" (at 236.22 556.26 0) (effects (font (size 0.9 0.9)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "02bed510-0e1d-50e8-a561-2929f289f526")) (text "AUTONOMOUS POWER WINDOW / RESET CANDIDATE - NOT MACHINE PERMISSION" (at 20.32 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 2.3 2.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1a234057-628d-5b82-be96-89407b161693")) (text "CORE5 -> core + ESP enables; valid core -> IO enable. IO qualifier -> FPGA reset.\nESP qualifier -> ESP reset only: ESP fault does not reset FPGA through this circuit.\nEvery EN also has the existing regulator10k pulldown. No active-high external driver allowed.\n5V/internal pullups never directly drive destination reset pins. Schmitt buffers use destination rails." (at 370.84 477.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4047702c-59de-5317-bc01-739795440ff8")) (text "Core threshold static margins are sub-mV at some corners. Aging, stress, ripple and transient\nresponse remain release blockers. Comparator40us maximum applies only at10% overdrive.\nNo guaranteed brownout slew, powered-off regulator discharge, shutdown order or restart latch.\nFPGA package/PLL filters, configuration, CDONE/user-mode guard and machine inhibit remain external.\nFour precision supervisors are a COST-RISK CANDIDATE, not a production BOM choice." (at 370.84 510.54 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "53750d49-e292-5565-bddf-32638234473e")))
